# Derived staging output, page caches for anchor building, and agent scratch files stay local.
# Tracked pipeline inputs: data/raw (feed indexes + cached source text used for provenance checks),
# data/staging/extra (events/research registries) and data/staging/curation.
data/*
!data/raw/
data/raw/vscode-pages/
!data/staging/
data/staging/*
!data/staging/extra/
!data/staging/curation/
scratch/
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

__pycache__/
